From: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 13:29:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 18/22] CK2 MXFP4 GPU support

- Keep CK2 MXFP4 variants on gfx950
- Preserve gfx90a non-FP4 and INT4 paths
- Reject gfx90a MXFP4 before JIT dispatch
- Test target filtering and runtime rejection

Tools used:
- GPT-5.6 Sol: gpt-5.6-sol-high

Signed-off-by: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
---
 aiter/fused_moe.py                   |  13 ++++
 aiter/jit/utils/moe_recipes.py       |  14 +++-
 op_tests/test_gfx90a_mxfp4_guards.py | 108 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 setup.py                             |  12 ++-
 4 files changed, 144 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 op_tests/test_gfx90a_mxfp4_guards.py

diff --git a/aiter/fused_moe.py b/aiter/fused_moe.py
